  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_01",
      "hash": "263ce8ccadf90788",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「啊！找到[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_06",
      "hash": "263cefccadf9136d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我就想說[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也差不多\\n該到紅蓮道館了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_07",
      "hash": "263ceeccadf911ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳贏過了夏伯？\\n……這樣啊，恭喜[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_02",
      "hash": "263cebccadf90ca1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要挑戰寶可夢聯盟\\n需要[VAR COLOR(0006)]８個[VAR COLOR(0000)]道館徽章對吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_08",
      "hash": "263ce1ccadf8fba3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我現在有７個！\\n也就是說剩下的就是……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_03",
      "hash": "263ceaccadf90aee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "果然只剩下[VAR COLOR(0006)]常青市[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n的道館了吧？\\r\\n之前去的時候沒人在呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_04",
      "hash": "263cedccadf91007",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳去過常青市的道館了嗎？\\r\\n應該還沒去吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1110_rival_05",
      "hash": "263cecccadf90e54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是不是該再去一次\\n常青市看看呢？"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
